md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cut</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH with cutting assy from 16M on 5,5in DP to 767M</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-10T10:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-10T12:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cut</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>LD 1x DP single. M/U spear assy. Removed PS21, installed master bushing. 
Inspected and greased up spear. 
RIH 1x stand of DC</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-10T12:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-10T13:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cut</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH from 821m to 900m on DP. Filled string. Up/down weights 106t/100t. RIH to 918.9m</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-10T13:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-10T14:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cut</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pulled up to 170t on hook load (10 ton overpull) in order to engage spear inside 10 3/4in csg and put casing in tension 
Started cutting casing: 1700l/min - 92 bar, 1800l/min - 97 bar,  1900l/min - 101 bar, 2000l/min - 104 bar. 
Pulled up to 187t on hook load (25t  overpull). Increased to 2200l/min - 124 bar. Casing cut at 915.2m</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-10T14:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-10T14:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cut</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pulled up through 10 3/4 hanger with 10 3/4in casing, ok to pass. 
RIH back, released spear from 10 3/4in casing fish</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-10T14:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-10T18:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pulled free of fish, hung up with grapple at 139.4m through hanger. Troubleshoot to get through. 
Attempted to pull with max 10 ton overpull - no success. 
Pulled up slowly and rotate to the right - no success. Tried to rotate to the left and pull - no success.  
Pulled and pumped with 200l/min - 4 bar, pressure increased to 30bar when took weight at 139.4m. 
RIH and engaged spear inside 10 3/4in csg, pulled same through the hanger - ok. 
Rotated it 4.5 turns to the left (2-3k torq) to reposition casing fish inside the well. Landed fish in the well and released spear. 
Attempted to pull spear through hanger - no success. Pulled up total of 3,4m from top of csg stump at 141.9m</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-10T18:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-10T21:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Evaluated situation. Discussed w/ onshore organisation. Meanwhile manufacturing c-plate to be able to hang off weight of the inner string
Decided way forward: 
- pull csg fish on spear 
- release spear from fish
- instal string stab above spear
- engage spear on surface, RIH fish on spear
- release spear, POOH</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-10T21:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-10T21:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to pull out fish on spear to surface</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-10T21:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-10T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Engaged spear to fish. POOH fish slowly. 
Top of fish hang up in hanger area. Rotated string 180 deg left, pulled up. Went through
When POOH observed overpull spikes on weight indicator several times. Max spike value of 40t</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-10T23:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-11T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/B 1x stand of DC, L/D bumper sub and string stab</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
